            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "content",
          "value": {
            "markup": "<p>The real power of MCP shines when you combine it with modern AI systems and content management platforms like Umbraco. Imagine agents that can autonomously manage your entire content ecosystem—creating, publishing, and organizing content while respecting all your business rules.</p><p><strong>What MCP Enables:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Content Agents:</strong> AI systems that understand document structures and hierarchies, making intelligent decisions about content placement and relationships</li><li><strong>Workflow Automation:</strong> Automatic content creation, publishing, and archival based on conditions and schedules</li><li><strong>Multi-System Coordination:</strong> Content flows seamlessly between Umbraco, your database, and other systems through a single protocol</li><li><strong>Developer Productivity:</strong> Spend time solving business problems instead of building infrastructure</li></ul><p>MCP isn't just a protocol—it's the foundation for the next generation of content management systems where AI and humans collaborate naturally to create better, faster, and smarter content workflows.</p>",
